OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FLow cloud quickly lifting to
OL,6,Fbright spells and a scattering of
OL,7,Fshowers. Cloud amounts increasing in
OL,8,Fthe north as rain moves in from the
OL,9,Fwest by late afternoon. Feeling warm
OL,10,Fand muggy where the sun holds on in
OL,11,Fthe south.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FRain, heavy at times, will
OL,14,Fmove southeastwards across the region
OL,15,Fthrough the evening and early hours.
OL,16,FStaying cloudy through the rest of the
OL,17,Fnight, with further spells of light
OL,18,Frain.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
